  "notes": "41:1-8 is not glossed: the tafsirs give several readings (and Al-Muyassar's is conquest). Geometric for «والله يحكم لا معقب لحكمه» and «فلله المكر جميعا يعلم ما تكسب كل نفس». 43 is the Prophet's ﷺ «قل»: no plate; 43:12-15 is not glossed (who «من عنده علم الكتاب» is differs). STAGING v4: Both chapters stay ambient: 41 (the land reduced from its edges: Al-Muyassar reads conquest) and 42 (the plotting of those before, all planning belongs to Allah); 43 is the disbelievers' denial of the Prophet ﷺ and his commanded answer («قل», no plate). Quiet over His judgement (41:9-16), His planning and knowledge (42:6-13) and the commanded words (43:6-15)."
